<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>nathonks</Major>
    <Description>This is a macro by nathonks
Use these setting for the best aim, fov 90 sensitivity 0.66 dpi 800

This is for the Rust M92 Semi-Auto Pistol ONLY and easy to use, you just have to bind the script to a key then you are beaming everyone. Simple script, auto spams the m92 pistol if you are too lazy

</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
MoveR 0 8
Delay 34 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 37 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Rust</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>